 "condorcet": {
  "_method": "Ladha (1992) correlated Condorcet jury. Gold = mechanical answer-correctness per (pattern,query) base report on the LitQA2+DeepSearchQA verifiable slice (reused from judge_vs_gold). Each judge's binary vote = thresholded overall_score_recomputed on the common report set scored by all 3 judges. p_i = accuracy vs gold; rho = pairwise correlation of ERROR indicators; correlated majority accuracy predicted by a beta-binomial (mean p_bar, intraclass corr rho_bar); N_eff = 3/(1+2*rho_bar) (same aggregation family as E3's n_eff=9/(3+2*sum phi)).",
